static const u8 sPip_SOOTOPOLIS_CITY_1[] = _("PIP: That water is so blue. I feel\nunderdressed in a color I already\lown.$");
static const u8 sPip_PACIFIDLOG_TOWN_0[] = _("PIP: The floor moves. I prefer to move\nvoluntarily.$");
static const u8 sPip_PACIFIDLOG_TOWN_1[] = _("PIP: A floating town! Every house is\ntechnically a houseboat with\lambition.$");
static const u8 sPip_EVER_GRANDE_CITY_0[] = _("PIP: Flowers at the finish line. They\nreally thought of everything.$");
static const u8 sPip_EVER_GRANDE_CITY_1[] = _("PIP: The LEAGUE is up there. Let us\nact like we meant to come this far.$");
static const u8 sPip_BATTLE_FRONTIER_0[] = _("PIP: An island devoted to battling.\nThe rest area deserves a facility\ltoo.$");
static const u8 sPip_BATTLE_FRONTIER_1[] = _("PIP: So many rules! My strategy\nremains: stand supportively over\lhere.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_101_0[] = _("PIP: Our first route! The grass did\nnot get any shorter while we were\laway.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_101_1[] = _("PIP: The ledge is a one-way shortcut.\nI learned the one-way part on the\lreturn trip.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_102_0[] = _("PIP: I like a path with a pond. It\ngives the puddles something to\laspire to.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_102_1[] = _("PIP: We could hurry through. Or watch\na WURMPLE be extremely busy on one\lleaf.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_103_0[] = _("PIP: A short walk and a lovely view. I\nsupport this approach to geography.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_103_1[] = _("PIP: Two banks, one river. Geography\nhas placed us on hold.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_104_0[] = _("PIP: A beach, some trees, a cottage.\nThis route packed for several\lholidays.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_104_1[] = _("PIP: I like a road with a beach. It\ngives getting lost a holiday\latmosphere.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_105_0[] = _("PIP: Water everywhere. I have\nmentally promoted every rock to an\lisland.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_105_1[] = _("PIP: All that sea, and someone still\nfound room for a route number.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_106_0[] = _("PIP: Those cave walls are doing an\nexcellent job of not being the ocean.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_106_1[] = _("PIP: The cave is right there. Shall we\nenjoy a moment of not being in it?$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_107_0[] = _("PIP: Still water. Still us. Still very\nlittle chance of a bench.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_107_1[] = _("PIP: Those rocks are having a staring\ncontest with the ocean. Neither has\lblinked.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_108_0[] = _("PIP: An abandoned ship. I hope it was\nabandoned for a really nice new ship.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_108_1[] = _("PIP: A wreck is a strange place to\nfeel hopeful. Still, somebody built it\lto go somewhere.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_109_0[] = _("PIP: A beach! I can finally blame the\nsand for what is in my shoes.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_109_1[] = _("PIP: The beach is free. That vendor is\nworking very hard to correct this.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_110_0[] = _("PIP: A whole road just for bikes.\nWalking feels like the budget edition.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_110_1[] = _("PIP: The cycling road has shade\nunderneath. Finally, progress\lbenefits pedestrians.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_111_0[] = _("PIP: So this is the long route. The\nmap was being unusually honest.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_111_1[] = _("PIP: The desert has no benches. I\nfeel that deserves a formal\lcomplaint.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_112_0[] = _("PIP: Mountain air! It comes with the\nmountain. There is always a catch.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_112_1[] = _("PIP: The mountain makes this look\nlike a short walk. Mountains are\lunreliable narrators.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_113_0[] = _("PIP: Ash falls like snow here. We\nshould be very specific about\lsnowballs.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_113_1[] = _("PIP: The ash is quiet when it falls. I\nexpected something that messy to\lannounce itself.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_114_0[] = _("PIP: Every view could be a painting.\nMine would include a large chair.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_114_1[] = _("PIP: If we stop by the water, please\nremind me we came here to travel.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_115_0[] = _("PIP: Cliffs, sea, more cliffs. Land\nreally enjoys a dramatic exit.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_115_1[] = _("PIP: A path that ends at the sea is\njust asking for an ambitious boat.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_116_0[] = _("PIP: A tunnel through a mountain.\nSomeone took a shortcut very\lseriously.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_116_1[] = _("PIP: That tunnel was somebody\nchoosing to see a person sooner. I\llike that.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_117_0[] = _("PIP: A nursery! Some POKÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¾Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â¦Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â©MON are\nhaving a much quieter adventure.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_117_1[] = _("PIP: The daycare looks peaceful. I\nassume the eggs handle the\lpaperwork.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_118_0[] = _("PIP: Two shores and a river. The map\nhas a very literal sense of division.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_118_1[] = _("PIP: The river divides the route. The\nfishermen seem to have accepted\ljoint custody.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_119_0[] = _("PIP: It is raining again. I am\nbeginning to recognize individual\lraindrops.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_119_1[] = _("PIP: It rains enough here that a dry\nsock qualifies as treasure.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_120_0[] = _("PIP: Bridges make walking over\nnothing feel strangely official.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_120_1[] = _("PIP: Even the puddles look deep in\nthought. We should give them room.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_121_0[] = _("PIP: This path has a lot of\ndestinations. I would also accept\llunch.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_121_1[] = _("PIP: A quiet road beside a noisy\nsafari. Excellent placement for\lanyone reconsidering a safari.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_122_0[] = _("PIP: That mountain looks important. I\nwill use my respectful walking voice.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_122_1[] = _("PIP: The mountain out there is full of\npeople being missed. We can walk a\llittle slower.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_123_0[] = _("PIP: Berries! A snack that grows its\nown packaging.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_123_1[] = _("PIP: The berry trees look\nlooked-after. It changes a place,\lwhen somebody bothers.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_124_0[] = _("PIP: The ocean is enormous. I have\nfiled a complaint with the horizon.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_124_1[] = _("PIP: Every island from here looks like\na place we almost recognize.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_125_0[] = _("PIP: A cave with tides. Even the floor\nhas visiting hours.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_125_1[] = _("PIP: The tide gets to rearrange its\nroom twice a day. I am a little\ljealous.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_126_0[] = _("PIP: A ring of sea around a city. Good\nluck giving directions to a delivery.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_126_1[] = _("PIP: A city inside a crater. Somebody\nlooked at that and said, excellent\lneighborhood.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_127_0[] = _("PIP: Deep blue water. My talent for\nstanding on land feels very\lspecialized.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_127_1[] = _("PIP: The water looks peaceful. I am\nchoosing not to ask what is\lunderneath.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_128_0[] = _("PIP: I am not saying the sea is\nsuspicious. It is being very\lmysterious.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_128_1[] = _("PIP: The League is close. We are\nallowed to be excited and nervous at\lthe same time.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_129_0[] = _("PIP: More ocean. The scenery has\ncommitted to its theme.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_129_1[] = _("PIP: Out here, a little island must\nfeel like finding a chair in a very\llarge room.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_130_0[] = _("PIP: If we see an island, please let me\ncompliment it in person.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_130_1[] = _("PIP: If a whole island turns up,\nplease let me be surprised before you\lexplain it.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_131_0[] = _("PIP: A tower out at sea. Someone\nreally wanted a quiet front door.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_131_1[] = _("PIP: The houses ahead are on water. I\nhope the mail carrier has excellent\lbalance.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_132_0[] = _("PIP: That current has plans. I hope\nours are on its list.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_132_1[] = _("PIP: That current is faster than my\ndecision-making. Let us pick our way\lcarefully.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_133_0[] = _("PIP: We are making good time. The\nwater has taken charge of our\lschedule.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_133_1[] = _("PIP: I would like to thank the rocks\nfor standing still. A rare courtesy\lout here.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_134_0[] = _("PIP: Fast water and hidden paths. I\npreferred the water that just sat\lthere.$");
static const u8 sPip_ROUTE_134_1[] = _("PIP: If we miss a turn, we can try\nagain. No need to call it a destiny.$");
